<view class="wrap"><view class="title">添加会员</view><view class="first-tip"><view class="big-title">第一次给会员建资料？</view><view class="hint">请返回“学员”页面，点右上角“＋新增”，先填写姓名和课时包。建好后打开会员详情，点“添加会员”，用编号或二维码把他加进你的通讯录。</view><button class="btn light" bindtap="backToStudents">返回学员列表</button></view><view class="hint">会员建档后，会员端会显示 M 开头编号和联系人二维码；用下面的编号或二维码就能把他加进你的会员列表。</view>
<view wx:if="{{way==='choose'}}" class="card big-row" bindtap="chooseCode"><view><view class="big-title">输入会员编号</view><view class="hint">例如 M12AB34CD</view></view><view class="arrow">›</view></view><view wx:if="{{way==='choose'}}" class="card big-row" bindtap="scan"><view><view class="big-title">扫描会员二维码</view><view class="hint">扫会员手机上的联系人码</view></view><view class="arrow">›</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{way==='code'}}" class="card"><input class="input" maxlength="9" value="{{code}}" placeholder="请输入 M 开头的会员编号" bindinput="onCode"/><button class="btn primary" loading="{{looking}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="lookup">查找会员</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{card}}" class="card"><view class="big-title">{{card.displayName}}</view><view class="hint">{{card.roleText}} · {{card.publicCode}}</view><button class="btn primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="add">添加到我的会员</button><view class="hint dim">核心资料由主管教练管理；你可以给这位会员排课、完课，收入记在你名下。</view></view><view wx:if="{{note}}" class="card hint">{{note}}</view></view>
